-- build
Insert t input=[#0:u.a #1:u.d #2:u.e] column_map=[0 1 2]
  Project [#0:u.a #1:u.d #2:u.e]
    Filter (#1:u.d > 1)
      Get u [#0:u.a #1:u.d #2:u.e]
